A.	the impairment is added back as a non-cash charge.
B.	impairments are recorded below operating income.
C.	the asset was sold for cash.
D.	impairments are not recognised under U.S. GAAP.
SC5-9  Profit is rising and payables are rising sharply. The analyst should note that:
A.	this is a sustainable source of funding.
